<title>USA: IMC Global Inc Q3 March 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>IMC Global Inc Q3 March 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.41     loss	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net	profit	 39,100     loss	 8,300</p>
<p> Revs		     664,800		  716,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  96,300		   93,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q3 includes merger-related special charges of $69.6 million or $0.75 a share. Excluding charges, year-ago operating income was $61.3 million, or $0.66 a share.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr   profit    $1.13	    profit$0.84</p>
<p> Net   profit    108,100	  profit77,900</p>
<p> Revs		1,993,800		2,025,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  95,100		   92,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1997 results are after $8.1 million or $0.09 a share extraordinary charge related to early extinguishment of debt. Excluding charge, earnings were $116.2 million or $1.22 a share.</p>
<p>Year-ago nine-month earnings are after special charges of $0.75 a share. Excluding charges, earnings were $147.5 million or $1.59 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
